702
00:30:42,160 --> 00:30:46,120
Um, and you basically reverse them in time, and you use a numerical model

703
00:30:46,140 --> 00:30:49,680
to play them back, so they retrace their steps back to time equals zero,

704
00:30:49,740 --> 00:30:51,620
where you get that initial pressure distribution.

705
00:30:52,220 --> 00:30:55,160
But the problem was the models that we had to do that time reversal

706
00:30:55,180 --> 00:30:58,340
were, were kind of too slow for that to be a useful technique.

707
00:30:58,440 --> 00:31:01,660
